ing must pass</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y \" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:240ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevInfo__5_4F5\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"delivery_stageIndex__Qe1_5 u-mono u-tnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"product_strong__md3es\">promote production</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_sevInfo__5_4F5\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevInfo__5_4F5\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Result<!-- -->: </span>Skipped</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">—</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO u-mono\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"argocd sync\">argocd sync</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_muted__1Uj0m\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"gate: smoke must pass · CHG-2026-1182\">gate: smoke must pass · CHG-2026-1182</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"product_panel__OdQEL\"><div class=\"product_panelHead__4kvE9\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevCritical__qnAYH product_sevCritical__qnAYH\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Stage result<!-- -->: </span>Failed</span><span class=\"product_panelTitle__JPdIG\">Stage <!-- -->11<!-- --> — <!-- -->integration</span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-mono\">vitest --project integration</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2:54</span></span></div><div class=\"delivery_logPanel__d_T5A\"><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\">The assertion below is the authorisation contract for<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono\">/v2/consignments/summary</span>. It is the same predicate whose absence let a replayed session read<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">1,106</span> records in the detection console — and it is caught here, in nine minutes, rather than in a report after the architecture has become load-bearing.</p><div class=\"delivery_log__nLomy product_sevCritical__qnAYH u-mono\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Log output from the integration stage\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D delivery_logMuted__YrrjM\">$ vitest run --project integration --reporter=verbose</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D delivery_logFail__Vt7h7\"> FAIL  test/integration/consignments.authz.spec.ts</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\">   tenant scoping &gt; reporting summary rejects a cross-tenant read</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\"> </span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D delivery_logFocus__6xPgS\">   AssertionError: expected status 403, received 200</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\">    at consignments.authz.spec.ts:118:22</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\"> </span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\">    116 |   const res = await client(OTHER_TENANT).get(route)</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\">    117 |</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D delivery_logFocus__6xPgS\">    118 |   expect(res.status).toBe(403)</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\">        |                      ^</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\">    119 |   expect(res.body.rows).toHaveLength(0)</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\"> </span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\">    route          GET /v2/consignments/summary</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\">    tenant         TEN-4471     principal  svc-reporting-export</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D delivery_logFocus__6xPgS\">    rows returned  1,106        expected   0</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\"> </span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D\">  Tests    1 failed · 211 passed (212)</span><span class=\"delivery_logLine__pOD_D delivery_logMuted__YrrjM\">  Duration 2:54  (setup 0:19, containers 0:31)</span></div><p class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Stages 12 to 14 did not run. The deploy gate requires integration to pass, and the production promotion additionally requires a change record —<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono\">CHG-2026-1182</span>.</p></div></div><div class=\"delivery_metricStrip__lh6Lf\"><div class=\"delivery_metric__EcC5Y\" style=\"--enter-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"delivery_metricValue__bf3Ec u-mono u-tnum\">3 h 41 m</span><span class=\"delivery_metricLabel___yjdr\">Lead time for change</span><span class=\"delivery_metricBasis__sKfhC\">p50, first commit on a branch to running in production. 1,026 changes in the 90 days to 2026-10-14.</span></div><div class=\"delivery_metric__EcC5Y\" style=\"--enter-delay:60ms\"><span class=\"delivery_metricValue__bf3Ec u-mono u-tnum\">11.4 / day</span><span class=\"delivery_metricLabel___yjdr\">Deployment frequency</span><span class=\"delivery_metricBasis__sKfhC\">Median production deploys per calendar day across the same 1,026 changes, weekends included.</span></div><div class=\"delivery_metric__EcC5Y\" style=\"--enter-delay:120ms\"><span class=\"delivery_metricValue__bf3Ec u-mono u-tnum\">4.7%</span><span class=\"delivery_metricLabel___yjdr\">Change failure rate</span><span class=\"delivery_metricBasis__sKfhC\">48 of those 1,026 deploys needed a rollback or a same-day fix forward.</span></div><div class=\"delivery_metric__EcC5Y\" style=\"--enter-delay:180ms\"><span class=\"delivery_metricValue__bf3Ec u-mono u-tnum\">18 m 22 s</span><span class=\"delivery_metricLabel___yjdr\">Time to restore service</span><span class=\"delivery_metricBasis__sKfhC\">p50 across those 48, from the alert firing to the service reporting healthy again.</span></div></div><div class=\"product_statusbar__oc8me\"><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Head <span class=\"u-mono\">a3f1c9e4b27d</span></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Pipeline <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">release · main</span></span><span class=\"product_statusSpacer__zs5xg\"></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Fix on <span class=\"u-mono\">fix/consignment-tenant-predicate</span> — merged<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:33:18 UTC</span></span></div></div><figcaption class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Representative view of the delivery pipeline. Illustrative data — not a client system.</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"pillar-security\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div data-reveal=\"\" class=\"hp-pillar2\"><div><p class=\"hp-pillar__index\">02 / 02</p><h2 id=\"pillar-security\" class=\"hp-pillar__name\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s3)\">Security practice</h2><p class=\"hp-pillar__line\">The in-house adversary that makes the build defensible.</p><p class=\"hp-pillar__body\">Our testers have shipped production systems themselves, which is why a finding arrives with a fix an engineer will accept rather than a recommendation an engineer has to translate. They also work for clients who never buy a line of code from us — testing, assurance, detection and response, sold on its own.</p><div class=\"hp-pillar__proof\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><div class=\"stat stat--md\"><p class=\"stat__figure u-tnum\"><span class=\"stat__roll\"><span class=\"stat__value\">1.4%</span></span></p><p class=\"stat__label\">false-positive rate at retest, across 2,140 confirmed findings</p></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\"><span>Security practice</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class=\"hp-console\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Managed SIEM alert queue, a wide console that scrolls horizontally\" tabindex=\"0\"><figure data-reveal=\"\" class=\"product_figure__CFsTQ\"><div class=\"product_console__JtIC_\" data-scene=\"3\"><div class=\"product_titlebar__rns9g\"><span class=\"product_titleGroup__MMGDe\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check product_titleIcon__O6a8i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"product_title__jwaL7\">Managed SIEM — Alert queue</span><span class=\"product_tenant__pmMjS\">Northwind Logistics Group<!-- --> · <span class=\"u-mono\">TEN-4471</span></span></span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2026-10-14 12:35–14:31 UTC</span></span></div><div class=\"produ