s=\"product_stateDot__YKybR product_stateDotOpen__UcqmX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Monitoring</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:240ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevMedium__b33PA\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevMedium__b33PA\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Medium</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">13:02:48</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\">NWL-LT-3862</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Spearphishing link clicked — domain registered 4 days ago\">Spearphishing link clicked — domain registered 4 days ago</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\" title=\"Phishing: Spearphishing Link\">T1566.002</span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\"> — <!-- -->Phishing: Spearphishing Link</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\">K. Osei</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_state__cr6xI\"><span class=\"product_stateDot__YKybR \" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Contained</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:240ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevLow__yBYsg\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Low</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">12:56:14</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\">reporting-etl-prod-05</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"LLMNR response observed on server VLAN\">LLMNR response observed on server VLAN</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\" title=\"Adversary-in-the-Middle: LLMNR/NBT-NS Poisoning and SMB Relay\">T1557.001</span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\"> — <!-- -->Adversary-in-the-Middle: LLMNR/NBT-NS Poisoning and SMB Relay</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\">A. Rahimi</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_state__cr6xI\"><span class=\"product_stateDot__YKybR product_stateDotOpen__UcqmX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Monitoring</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:240ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevLow__yBYsg\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Low</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">12:48:37</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\">NWL-WS-1174</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Local account created outside the joiner process\">Local account created outside the joiner process</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\" title=\"Create Account: Local Account\">T1136.001</span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\"> — <!-- -->Create Account: Local Account</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Unassigned<span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\"> analyst</span></span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_state__cr6xI\"><span class=\"product_stateDot__YKybR product_stateDotOpen__UcqmX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>New</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:240ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevLow__yBYsg\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Low</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">12:41:20</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\">edge-waf-lhr-02</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Outbound DNS-over-HTTPS to non-approved resolver\">Outbound DNS-over-HTTPS to non-approved resolver</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\" title=\"Protocol Tunneling\">T1572</span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\"> — <!-- -->Protocol Tunneling</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Unassigned<span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\"> analyst</span></span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_state__cr6xI\"><span class=\"product_stateDot__YKybR product_stateDotOpen__UcqmX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>New</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:240ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevInfo__5_4F5\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevInfo__5_4F5\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Info</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">12:35:09</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\">identity-broker-prod-02</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Break-glass account checked out and returned (28 min)\">Break-glass account checked out and returned (28 min)</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\" title=\"Valid Accounts: Cloud Accounts\">T1078.004</span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\"> — <!-- -->Valid Accounts: Cloud Accounts</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\">J. Castellanos</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_state__cr6xI\"><span class=\"product_stateDot__YKybR product_stateDotOpen__UcqmX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Monitoring</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"product_panel__OdQEL\"><div class=\"product_panelHead__4kvE9\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevCritical__qnAYH\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Critical</span><span class=\"product_panelTitle__JPdIG\"><span class=\"u-mono\">ENX-88214</span> — <!-- -->Impossible travel followed by privileged API enumeration</span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><span class=\"u-mono\">ENX-DET-0412 v7</span> ·<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono\">T1078.004</span> <span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Valid Accounts: Cloud Accounts</span></span></div><div class=\"product_panelBody__TbKeY\"><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\">Session for d.okafor authenticated from AS9009 (Bucharest) 91 seconds after a successful MFA sign-in from the London office range, then enumerated 1,106 booking records through /v2/consignments before the token was revoked.</p><div><p class=\"product_sectionLabel__iRUDV\">Evidence</p><dl class=\"product_kv__qZr9Y\"><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Principal</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">d.okafor@northwind-logistics.example</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Source address</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">45.147.231.86</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Source ASN</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">AS9009 — M247 Europe SRL</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Prior sign-in</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">10.42.26.144 · 14:20:36 UTC</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Session token</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">eyJhbGci…a3f1c9e4b2</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Records touched</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">1,106 of 48,312</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Detection latency</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS \">91 s from first anomalous call</dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"product_step2__X16s2\"><p class=\"product_sectionLabel__iRUDV\">Triage notes</p><ol class=\"product_notes__lyeOr\"><li class=\"product_note__lrnYE\" style=\"--enter-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"product_noteMeta__tbFlh\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:22:41<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">K. Osei</span></span><p class=\"product_noteBody__esLIG\">Confirmed the 14:20:36 sign-in is genuine — device NWL-LT-4417, compliant, MFA satisfied. The 14:22:07 session reuses the same refresh token from a hosting ASN. Token theft, not a shared account.</p></li><li class=\"product_note__lrnYE\" style=\"--enter-delay:60ms\"><span class=\"product_noteMeta__tbFlh\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:24:09<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">M. Thorne</span></span><p class=\"product_noteBody__esLIG\">Pulled the browser credential store timeline on NWL-LT-4417. ENX-88209 fired on the same host at 14:03:58 for T1555.003. That is the acquisition step. Treating as one chain, not two alerts.</p></li><li class=\"product_note__lrnYE\" style=\"--enter-delay:120ms\"><span class=\"product_noteMeta__tbFlh\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:26:55<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">M. Thorne</span></span><p class=\"product_noteBody__esLIG\">Revoked all refresh tokens for the principal, forced re-enrolment, isolated NWL-LT-4417. Client security lead (R. Venkatesan) acknowledged on the bridge at 14:26:12.</p></li></ol></div><div class=\"product_step3___C_Q0\"><div class=\"product_verdict__bReey\"><span class=\"product_verdictHead__uYXXj\"><span class=\"product_verdictLabel__rB0nq\">Analyst conclusion</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:29:33<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">M. Thorne</span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Incident <span class=\"u-mono\">INC-2026-0417</span></span></span><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\"><strong class=\"product_strong__md3es\">True positive — confirmed credential theft and replay. No data exfiltration observed.</strong></p><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\">Tokens revoked, host isolated, egress to AS9009 blocked at the edge. 1,106 accessed records enumerated for the client’s notification assessment; booking payloads are not special-category data.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"product_statusbar__oc8me\"><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\"><span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">9</span> open</span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Log sources<!-- --> <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R u-mono u-tnum\">312<!-- -->/<!-- -->317</span> <!-- -->healthy</span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">4.18 bn</span> events/day</span><span class=\"product_statusSpacer__zs5xg\"></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Incident <span class=\"u-mono\">INC-2026-0417</span> · commander<!-- --> <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">M. Thorne</span></span></div></div><figcaption class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Representative view of the managed SIEM console. Illustrative data — not a client estate.</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"join-heading\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div data-reveal=\"\" class=\"hp-join\"><div><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">The seam</p><h2 id=\"join-heading\" class=\"hp-join__heading\">Secure SDLC</h2><p class=\"hp-join__body\">The page nobody else has built, because for most firms there is nothing to put on it. One backlog, one set of priorities, one team accountable — and a number you can check.</p><div class=\"hp-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/services/devsecops\"><span>See the model</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3333333333333335\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div><div class=\"hp-seam__labels\"><span>Software development</span><span>Security practice</span></div><svg class=\"hp-seam\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 72\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 4 V28 C8 44 48 44 96 44 H224 C272 44 312 44 312 28 V4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path><path d=\"M160 44 V68\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path></svg><p class=\"hp-join__figure u-tnum\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s6)\">9 days</p><p class=\"hp-join__figure-label\">median from a finding being confirmed to the fix being live in production</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"work-heading\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"hp-work\"><div data-reveal=\"\" class=\"hp-work__intro\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">The work</p><h2 id=\"work-heading\" class=\"hp-h2 hp-h2--wide\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s4)\">What the work actually looks like</h2><p class=\"hp-lede\">One client estate, one afternoon, six consoles. The integration test that fails in the pipeline asserts the same tenant predicate whose absence shows up in the detection queue; the pull request that fixes it is a ticket on the board; the rollback on the release panel is another ticket on the same board. They are views of one system, not four mood boards.</p><p class=\"hp-work__note\">Drawn in HTML, CSS and SVG rather than captured from a vendor console — so they stay sharp at any zoom, render correctly in every palette, and belong to nobody else. Every hostname, ticket, figure and amount is invented. One fictional tenant, Northwind Logistics Group, runs through all of them.</p></div><section class=\"ch\" id=\"work-review\" aria-labelledby=\"work-review-title\"><div class=\"ch__head\"><span class=\"ch__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><h2 class=\"ch__title\" id=\"work-review-title\">A security finding is a comment on a line of code</h2><p class=\"ch__lede\">The same finding, arriving in the form the person who will change it can act on.</p><div class=\"ch__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"ch__body\"><div data-reveal=\"\" class=\"hp-work__prose\"><p>Pull request 482 fixes a reporting query that returned rows for every tenant rather than the caller’s. Continuous review raised it on 13 October; the fix merged at 14:33 the following afternoon. What makes it cheap is where the conversation happened — on line 148, in the branch, with the author already in the file — rather than in a document four months later that somebody has to translate back into a ticket.</p><p>The second comment in that thread is the part worth reading. The security engineer approves the fix and still asks for a follow-up, because the database view underneath has no tenant predicate of its own and whoever writes the third caller would repeat the bug. That follow-up is pointed into the same sprint before this change is allowed to merge.</p></div><div class=\"hp-console\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Pull request 482 under review, a wide console that scrolls horizontally\" tabindex=\"0\"><figure data-reveal=\"\" class=\"product_figure__CFsTQ\"><div class=\"product_console__JtIC_\"><div class=\"product_titlebar__rns9g\"><span class=\"product_titleGroup__MMGDe\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-pull-request product_titleIcon__O6a8i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M13 6h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"9\" y2=\"21\"></line></svg><span class=\"product_title__jwaL7\">Pull request <!-- -->482</span><span class=\"product_tenant__pmMjS\"><span class=\"u-mono\">northwind/freight-booking-api</span> · <!-- -->Northwind Logistics Group</span></span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><span class=\"u-mono\">fix/consignment-tenant-predicate</span><span>→</span><span class=\"u-mono\">main</span></span></div><div class=\"delivery_commitBar__Jh_gL\"><span class=\"delivery_commitMsg__lu7O_\">Scope the reporting summary to the caller’s tenant</span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\"><span class=\"u-mono\">NWL-4471</span> · opened<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2026-10-14 09:12:40</span> by<!-- --> <!-- -->D. Marchetti</span></div><dl class=\"delivery_facts__FCEgv\"><div class=\"delivery_fact__pthd2\" style=\"--enter-delay:0ms\"><dt class=\"delivery_factKey__qphev\">State</dt><dd class=\"delivery_factVal__Lkdp5\" style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Review state<!-- -->: </span>Approved — 2 of 2 required reviews</span></dd></div><div class=\"delivery_fact__pthd2\" style=\"--enter-delay:60ms\"><dt class=\"delivery_factKey__qphev\">Change</dt><dd class=\"delivery_factVal__Lkdp5\" style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">+<!-- -->38<!-- --> −<!-- -->11<!-- --> across <!-- -->4<!-- --> <!-- -->files</span></dd></div><div class=\"delivery_fact__pthd2\" style=\"--enter-delay:120ms\"><dt class=\"delivery_factKey__qphev\">Head</dt><dd class=\"delivery_factVal__Lkdp5\" style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"u-mono\">6f2ab84<!-- --> · <!-- -->3<!-- --> commits</span></dd></div><div class=\"delivery_fact__pthd2\" style=\"--enter-delay:180ms\"><dt class=\"delivery_factKey__qphev\">Merged</dt><dd class=\"delivery_factVal__Lkdp5\" style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2026-10-14 14:33:18<!-- --> UTC</span></dd></div></dl><div class=\"delivery_prSplit__LjENt\"><div class=\"delivery_prBlock__po_05\"><p class=\"product_sectionLabel__iRUDV\">Reviewers</p><ul class=\"delivery_reviewerList__fvxne\"><li class=\"delivery_reviewer__NXAqy product_sevLow__yBYsg\" style=\"--enter-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"delivery_reviewerName__kMApq\">K. Osei</span><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Review<!-- -->: </span>Approved</span><span class=\"delivery_rowSpacer__M_QZC\"></span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Security practice — required</span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m u-mono u-tnum\">14:12:31</span></li><li class=\"delivery_reviewer__NXAqy product_sevLow__yBYsg\"