 product_sevInfo__5_4F5\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Reconciliation<!-- -->: </span>Reconciled, noted</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">1400</span><span class=\"product_strong__md3es\">Stock — finished goods</span><span class=\"delivery_noteText__HMKjl\">Three warehouses. One of them recorded stock adjustments with the sign reversed from a 2014 system change until the migration restated them; account 6200 below is that restatement, not a movement.</span></li><li class=\"delivery_noteRow__MN_eI product_sevMedium__b33PA\" style=\"--enter-delay:60ms\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevMedium__b33PA\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Reconciliation<!-- -->: </span>Awaiting evidence</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2200</span><span class=\"product_strong__md3es\">VAT control</span><span class=\"delivery_noteText__HMKjl\">The return acknowledgement had not reached the evidence store when the ledger was frozen. Carried as an open point on the approval rather than quietly ticked.</span></li><li class=\"delivery_noteRow__MN_eI product_sevInfo__5_4F5\" style=\"--enter-delay:120ms\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevInfo__5_4F5\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Reconciliation<!-- -->: </span>Reconciled, noted</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">6200</span><span class=\"product_strong__md3es\">Stock valuation adjustment</span><span class=\"delivery_noteText__HMKjl\">Restatement of the sign reversal across eleven years. Reviewed by the Financial Controller and the migration lead; working paper WP-2026-10-14.</span></li><li class=\"delivery_noteRow__MN_eI product_sevLow__yBYsg\" style=\"--enter-delay:180ms\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\