ing needs two Finance Director approvals and raises a change record.</span></span></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"product_panel__OdQEL\"><div class=\"product_panelHead__4kvE9\"><span class=\"product_panelTitle__JPdIG\">Controls exercised in this period</span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">4</span> <!-- -->enforced ·<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">1</span> <!-- -->carrying an exception</span></div><div class=\"product_scrollerUnmasked__tWGcn\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Controls exercised in this period, scrolls horizontally\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"product_table__XMZjK delivery_controlTable___4lN7\" role=\"table\" aria-label=\"Controls exercised in this period\"><div class=\"product_head__PTccq\" role=\"row\"><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">Control</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">What it enforces</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">State</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">Evidence this period</span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevLow__yBYsg u-mono\" role=\"cell\">FIN-SOD-02</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"A preparer may not approve their own period\">A preparer may not approve their own period</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_sevLow__yBYsg\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Control state<!-- -->: </span>Enforced</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_muted__1Uj0m\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"1 attempt refused this period, at 17:44:51 on 2 November.\">1 attempt refused this period, at 17:44:51 on 2 November.</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:60ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevLow__yBYsg u-mono\" role=\"cell\">FIN-SOD-04</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Purchase orders over £10,000.00 need a second approver\">Purchase orders over £10,000.00 need a second approver</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_sevLow__yBYsg\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Control state<!-- -->: </span>Enforced</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_muted__1Uj0m\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Enforced in the API, not only in the interface. Our own pre-go-live test found the threshold had existed in the interface alone; ticket NWL-4437 closed that on 2026-09-18.\">Enforced in the API, not only in the interface. Our own pre-go-live test found the threshold had existed in the interface alone; ticket NWL-4437 closed that on 2026-09-18.</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:120ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevLow__yBYsg u-mono\" role=\"cell\">FIN-GL-07</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Suspense must be zero before a period can close\">Suspense must be zero before a period can close</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_sevLow__yBYsg\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Control state<!-- -->: </span>Enforced</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_muted__1Uj0m\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Account 9500 cleared at 16:51 UTC on 2 November.\">Account 9500 cleared at 16:51 UTC on 2 November.</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:180ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevLow__yBYsg u-mono\" role=\"cell\">FIN-GL-11</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Manual journals over £25,000.00 need a second pair of eyes\">Manual journals over £25,000.00 need a second pair of eyes</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_sevLow__yBYsg\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Control state<!-- -->: </span>Enforced</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_muted__1Uj0m\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"2 journals this period; both reviewed by the Financial Controller.\">2 journals this period; both reviewed by the Financial Controller.</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:240ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevMedium__b33PA u-mono\" role=\"cell\">FIN-EV-01</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Every reconciliation carries its evidence\">Every reconciliation carries its evidence</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_sevMedium__b33PA\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevMedium__b33PA\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Control state<!-- -->: </span>Exception</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_muted__1Uj0m\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"15 of 16 lines evidenced at freeze. Account 2200 is outstanding — see the approval chain.\">15 of 16 lines evidenced at freeze. Account 2200 is outstanding — see the approval chain.</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"product_panelBody__TbKeY\"><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\"><span class=\"u-mono\">FIN-SOD-04</span> is annotated “enforced in the API, not only in the interface” because that is precisely what our own pre-go-live test found: the purchase-order approval threshold existed in the interface alone, so a requisitioner could have approved their own order with a crafted request. It is ticket <span class=\"u-mono\">NWL-4437</span> on the delivery board, closed on<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2026-09-18</span> — a finance control, found by the security practice, fixed by the engineers who built it, in the same sprint cadence as everything else.</p></div></div><div class=\"product_statusbar__oc8me\"><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Prepared <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">H. Ndiaye</span></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Reviewed <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">P. Lindqvist</span></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Approved <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">J. Abara</span></span><span class=\"product_statusSpacer__zs5xg\"></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Reopening <span class=\"u-mono\">2026-10</span> needs two Finance Director approvals</span></div></div><figcaption class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Representative view of a month-end close. Illustrative data — not a client system.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"ch\" id=\"work-run\" aria-labelledby=\"work-run-title\"><div class=\"ch__head\"><span class=\"ch__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span><h2 class=\"ch__title\" id=\"work-run-title\">And the practice that watches it afterwards</h2><p class=\"ch__lede\">Everything above is the build. These three are the run.</p><div class=\"ch__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"ch__body\"><div data-reveal=\"\" class=\"hp-work__prose\"><p>The endpoint fleet, the edge, and the service-level report the client reads each month. Same tenant, same afternoon, same incident as the detection queue further up this page — which is the argument rather than a coincidence of fixtures. A firm that builds the system and then watches it is reading its own architecture at three in the morning, not meeting it at handover.</p></div><div class=\"hp-work__tabs\"><div dir=\"ltr\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" class=\"\"><div role=\"tablist\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\" class=\"tabs__list\" aria-label=\"Managed service consoles\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" style=\"outline:none\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_9la9autb_-content-edr\" data-state=\"active\" id=\"radix-_R_9la9autb_-trigger-edr\" class=\"tabs__trigger\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Endpoint fleet</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_9la9autb_-content-waf\" data-state=\"inactive\" id=\"radix-_R_9la9autb_-trigger-waf\" class=\"tabs__trigger\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Edge traffic</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_9la9autb_-content-sla\" data-state=\"inactive\" id=\"radix-_R_9la9autb_-trigger-sla\" class=\"tabs__trigger\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Service level</button></div><div data-state=\"active\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_9la9autb_-trigger-edr\" id=\"ra