<ul class=\"reveal-group hp-grid hp-grid--3\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg hp-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bug hp-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v-9\"></path><path d=\"M14 7a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v3a6 6 0 0 1-12 0v-3a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z\"></path><path d=\"M14.12 3.88 16 2\"></path><path d=\"M21 21a4 4 0 0 0-3.81-4\"></path><path d=\"M21 5a4 4 0 0 1-3.55 3.97\"></path><path d=\"M22 13h-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 21a4 4 0 0 1 3.81-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 5a4 4 0 0 0 3.55 3.97\"></path><path d=\"M6 13H2\"></path><path d=\"m8 2 1.88 1.88\"></path><path d=\"M9 7.13V6a3 3 0 1 1 6 0v1.13\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"hp-card__title\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></h3><p class=\"hp-card__line\">Manual, evidence-led testing with criticals reported the hour they are confirmed.</p><div class=\"hp-card__foot\"><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Cybersecurity</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg hp-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-code2 lucide-file-code-2 hp-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"m5 12-3 3 3 3\"></path><path d=\"m9 18 3-3-3-3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"hp-card__title\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></h3><p class=\"hp-card__line\">Secure code review, CI gates and threat models that engineers will actually maintain.</p><div class=\"hp-card__foot\"><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Cybersecurity</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg hp-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radar hp-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35\"></path><path d=\"M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"hp-card__title\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></h3><p class=\"hp-card__line\">24/7 detection and response on your telemetry, with detections written for your architecture.</p><div class=\"hp-card__foot\"><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Cybersecurity</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arro