"className\":\"delivery_commentBody__J5oBU\",\"children\":\"This fixes this caller. The view still has no tenant predicate of its own, so whoever writes the third caller in 2028 repeats the bug and nothing catches it. Raise the follow-up before this merges — I will approve either way, but I want the ticket to exist.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2026-10-14 12:06:19\",{\"className\":\"delivery_comment__bDtaR\",\"style\":{\"--enter-delay\":\"60ms\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"delivery_commentHead__JuBmt\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"delivery_commentAuthor__v2uzl\",\"children\":\"D. Marchetti\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Author\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono u-tnum\",\"children\":[\"2026-10-14 12:06:19\",\" UTC\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"delivery_commentBody__J5oBU\",\"children\":\"NWL-4488 raised and pointed into this sprint. Keeping the assertion here as well as in the view when that lands: two places that both have to be wrong beats one place that has to be right.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2026-10-14 14:29:51\",{\"className\":\"delivery_comment__bDtaR\",\"style\":{\"--enter-delay\":\"120ms\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"delivery_commentHead__JuBmt\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"delivery_commentAuthor__v2uzl\",\"children\":\"A. Whitfield\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Code owner, consignments\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono u-tnum\",\"children\":[\"2026-10-14 14:29:51\",\" UTC\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"delivery_commentBody__J5oBU\",\"children\":\"assertTenantScoped throws for a principal with no tenant_ref, which is what svc-reporting-export runs as. Added that case to the authz contract suite so the path is covered rather than assumed — 64 routes, 0 unscoped.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\na5:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"product_statusbar__oc8me\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":11,\"height\":11,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-minus\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"aria-label\":\"\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1ays0h\",{\"d\":\"M5 12h14\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\"Branch protection: 2 approvals, 1 from the security practice\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"product_statusSpacer__zs5xg\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\",\"children\":[\"Follow-up \",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono\",\"children\":\"NWL-4488\"}],\" raised before merge\"]}]]}]\na6:[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"product_caption__f0O7Y\",\"children\":\"Representative view of a pull request under review. Illustrative data — not a client system.\"}]\na8:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ch__head\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"ch__num\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"02\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"ch__title\",\"id\":\"work-release-title\",\"children\":\"Then the part that only shows up after it ships\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"ch__lede\",\"children\":\"Deploys, errors, latency at the tail, and the two releases that were withdrawn.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ch__rule\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]]}]\na9:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ch__body\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L45\",null,{\"className\":\"hp-work__prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"137 production deploys in fourteen days, a median of 11.5 a day, two of them rolled back — one restored in 6 minutes 11 seconds, the other in 3 minutes 2 seconds. Both are marked on the chart and both are written out underneath with the cause and the ticket, because a release-health panel with no rollbacks on it is